WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.124 --> 00:00:05.707
Hello there!

2
00:00:10.132 --> 00:00:11.909
Who are you?

3
00:00:12.853 --> 00:00:15.548
I am an albatross.

4
00:00:16.596 --> 00:00:20.257
Albatrosses are seabirds.

5
00:00:22.645 --> 00:00:25.884
Your wings are so long!

6
00:00:27.246 --> 00:00:30.881
We have the biggest wingspan of any bird.

7
00:00:31.672 --> 00:00:35.447
My wingspan is over three meters.

8
00:00:36.209 --> 00:00:38.297
Where do you live?

9
00:00:39.015 --> 00:00:42.308
We mostly live in the Southern Hemisphere.

10
00:00:43.558 --> 00:00:47.054
We fly all over the ocean.

11
00:00:47.497 --> 00:00:50.664
We can fly long and far.

12
00:00:52.393 --> 00:00:56.868
Really? Do you ever go on land?

13
00:00:59.085 --> 00:01:01.068
Sometimes.

14
00:01:01.757 --> 00:01:06.940
We go on land to see our mates.

15
00:01:07.476 --> 00:01:11.050
Parents also feed their chicks on land.

16
00:01:12.452 --> 00:01:15.126
How long can you fly?

17
00:01:15.783 --> 00:01:19.469
We can travel for years and years.

18
00:01:20.426 --> 00:01:25.306
We glide on the winds like this. Whee!

19
00:01:27.541 --> 00:01:30.398
Why don't you flap your wings?

20
00:01:31.180 --> 00:01:34.229
Our wings are very heavy.

21
00:01:36.316 --> 00:01:38.558
So we don't flap them much.

22
00:01:40.002 --> 00:01:43.241
We save energy when we glide.

23
00:01:44.109 --> 00:01:46.132
What do you eat?

24
00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:50.358
We mainly eat squid and fish.

25
00:01:50.607 --> 00:01:54.245
We can smell food twenty kilometers away.

26
00:01:54.839 --> 00:01:58.256
When we smell food, we dive down.

27
00:01:59.854 --> 00:02:02.921
Oh! I smell a snack.

28
00:02:03.741 --> 00:02:05.998
Time for a dive!

29
00:02:06.444 --> 00:02:09.475
Good-bye, Albatross.

